  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.idle.1": "Rare glyphs, traveler. Care to take a look?",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.idle.2": "Mana in the air... feel that tingle?",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.idle.3": "I crossed three kingdoms for a single glyph.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.idle.4": "Hmm, where did I leave my grimoire...",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.idle.5": "A mage is never lost. Just taking the long way.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.idle.6": "Beware the towers. Not everything that shines up there is friendly.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.idle.7": "Fresh mana crystals, right here!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.greet.0": "Ah, a customer! Welcome.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.greet.1": "Greetings, traveler. Have a look at my wares.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.greet.2": "May mana be with you. What are you looking for?",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.greet.3": "Good timing, I just restocked.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.greet.4": "Hello! Take your time.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.thanks.0": "Excellent choice!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.thanks.1": "Use it wisely.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.thanks.2": "Deal. May mana guide you!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.thanks.3": "Thank you, come again.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.thanks.4": "That glyph will serve you well.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.hurt.0": "Hey! That was rude.",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.hurt.1": "Ouch! I'll keep my distance...",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.hurt.2": "No violence against the mage!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.hurt.3": "Hmph. Farewell!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.danger.0": "Stay behind me!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.danger.1": "Monster ahead!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.danger.2": "Arcane missile!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.danger.3": "Back off, creature!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.leave.0": "Well, the road calls. Until next time!",
  "entity.isekai_mahou.wandering_mage.line.leave.1": "Time to go. May the stars guide you.",
